black .

# Lint code
ruff check .

# Type checking
mypy memory_module
```

### Database Migrations

```bash
# Create a new migration
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# Apply migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Rollback migration
alembic downgrade -1
```

